   437	            # markers read here cannot be raced by another handle: whatever
   438	            # a concurrent writer stamped is already visible, and nothing
   439	            # further can land until we commit or roll back. Increment from
   440	            # that committed value — never from a per-handle cache, which
   441	            # would stamp a stale count over another writer's correct one
   442	            # and brick the store on the next open.
   443	            marked = self._marked_counts()
