   487	        then already derived ``prev_hash``, ``window_start`` and the fact
   488	        cursor from an index that may not have consumed a durable line. The
   489	        successor would link past the orphan, and that mis-linkage goes into
   490	        the canonical log itself — where no later catch-up or rebuild can
   491	        repair it. Reconciling in front of the derivation costs two syscalls
   492	        when the index is current.
   493	        """
   494	        self._reconcile()
