Two residual issues are now evidence-backed. First, task writes honor cwd but task reads still resolve the packaged vertex’s directory, so a workspace `.jsonl` write can be invisible to status/fold commands. Second, rebuild cleanup covers constructor failures but not failures while reading the completed target’s receipt; that leaves the target and blocks retry. The validate/build race is also real, though the only in-tree CLI flow uses a fresh, quiescent export.
